Expose the trace sink RAM interface as ports (EXTERNAL_SINK_MEM)

Upstream instantiates trace_mem inside trace_wrapper, so the sink RAM cells are
internal to the DFD block. OCAH keeps the eight sink RAMs outside the block, in
smc_dfd_wrap's parent, the way the previous hw/ip/dfd/rtl dfd_top did via its
funnel_mem_SinkMemPktIn_ANY / mem_funnel_SinkMemPktOut_ANY ports.

  - trace_mem_pkg.svh (new): SinkMemPktIn_s/SinkMemPktOut_s were a local typedef
    inside trace_wrapper and so could not appear on a port. Moved to a package,
    mirroring what the old hw/ip/dfd/rtl/pkg/dfd_trace_mem_pkg.svh did. The
    structs are bit-identical to the local ones at TRC_RAM_INDEX = 256.
  - trace_wrapper.sv: add EXTERNAL_SINK_MEM (default 0, so existing internal-RAM
    users are unaffected), expose o_sink_mem_req / i_sink_mem_rsp, and make the
    trace_mem instance conditional. Elaboration-checks TRC_RAM_INDEX against the
    package constant.
  - dfd_top_cla_dst_apb.sv: plumb the parameter and both ports through.

Upstreaming this to tt_hw_debug would drop this patch. The other seven generated
tops need the matching .o_sink_mem_req()/.i_sink_mem_rsp('0) tie-off, but OCAH
does not vendor them, so that part is not carried here.

diff --git a/rtl/trace/trace_mem_pkg.svh b/rtl/trace/trace_mem_pkg.svh
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..484731a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/rtl/trace/trace_mem_pkg.svh
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+`ifndef TRACE_MEM_PKG_SVH
+`define TRACE_MEM_PKG_SVH
+
+package trace_mem_pkg;
+
+  // Sink RAM depth these structs are sized for. trace_wrapper elaboration-checks
+  // its TRC_RAM_INDEX parameter against this; the two must agree for the packet
+  // structs to be usable on a port.
+  localparam TRC_RAM_INDEX       = 256;
+  localparam TRC_RAM_INDEX_WIDTH = $clog2(TRC_RAM_INDEX);
+
+  typedef struct packed {
+    logic                                  mem_chip_en;
+    logic                                  mem_wr_en;
+    logic [TRC_RAM_INDEX_WIDTH-1:0]        mem_wr_addr;
+    logic                                  mem_wr_mask_en;
+    logic [tn_pkg::TRC_RAM_DATA_WIDTH-1:0] mem_wr_data;
+  } SinkMemPktIn_s;
+
+  typedef struct packed {
+    logic [tn_pkg::TRC_RAM_DATA_WIDTH-1:0] mem_rd_data;
+  } SinkMemPktOut_s;
+
+endpackage
+
+`endif
